flowchart TB
  Human["Human objective<br/>faithful source or explicit research target"]:::human
  DAG["Live source / theorem / Lean DAG"]:::dag
  Coordinator["Thin Coordinator<br/>select independent SAUs · suppress duplicates"]:::coordinator
  Proposed["PROPOSED"]:::state
  Claimed["CLAIMED"]:::state
  Exploring["EXPLORING<br/>Generalist Worker<br/>temporary specialist modes"]:::worker
  Proved["PROVED_LOCAL<br/>theorem delta · files · checks · truth boundary"]:::proved
  Verified["VERIFIED<br/>independent evidence"]:::verified
  Stable["STABILIZING<br/>single current-main lane"]:::stable
  Merged["MERGED<br/>canonical PR + commit"]:::merged
  Blocked["BLOCKED / QUARANTINED<br/>exact smaller boundary or reason"]:::blocked
  Discovery["Discovery Ledger<br/>raw → validated → scheduled → merged"]:::ledger
  Memory["Samplinglib Registry · graph · theorem memory"]:::memory

  Human --> DAG --> Coordinator --> Proposed --> Claimed --> Exploring --> Proved --> Verified --> Stable --> Merged --> Memory
  Exploring -->|cross-layer idea| Discovery
  Discovery -->|validated| Coordinator
  Claimed --> Blocked
  Exploring --> Blocked
  Proved --> Blocked
  Stable --> Blocked
  Blocked -->|new owner / revised route| Claimed
  Memory -. reusable result .-> DAG

